SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) - EP Meadow View Ride (31R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\nRide leader: Denine Chemnitz\nAnticipated Average Pac
 e: (14-16 mph)\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-meadow
 -view-ride-31r/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-meadow-view-r
 ide-31r/)\n\nThis is an Intermediate C Class ride. The ride leader will ri
 de at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride wi
 th a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best t
 o keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitting int
 o multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join thi
 s ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed the po
 sted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster
  group. If maintaining a 14-16 mph average is beyond your current ability 
 level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandat
 ory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, t
 ire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and 
 paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to joi
 n this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join her
 e [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=6
 0&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Co
 de of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content
 .aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incide
 nt occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144301
